  "ghost_null_definition": "per llm_sham window: every ghost sub-run of its seed group, replayed rivals cyclically shifted against its live dealer (features.n_shifts shifts), TE summary minus the mean TE of the ghost set (the sham's own D5 netting term); sham_pooled pools the draws of the qualified trunks of lane H; q95 = 0.95 quantile of the finite draws"
